{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"u20_r6q_88g","canonical_person_id":"u20_r6q_88g","id_aliases":[],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["u20_r6q_88g"],"persons":[{"id":"u20_r6q_88g","label":"安國少季（南越列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"安國少季","mention_ids":["c-shiji-113-nanyue:m007-0027","c-shiji-113-nanyue:m007-0046","c-shiji-113-nanyue:m007-0116"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m007-0027","chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p007","quote":"安國少季"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m007-0046","chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p007","quote":"安國少季"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m007-0116","chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p007","quote":"安國少季"}]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji113-nanyue","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-113","chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","mention_count":3,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-113-nanyue:m007-0027","c-shiji-113-nanyue:m007-0046","c-shiji-113-nanyue:m007-0116"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-113-nanyue:p007"],"table_cell_ids":[],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji113-nanyue"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"person_id":"u20_r6q_88g","title":null,"surname":"安國","ming":null,"additional_names":["字少季"],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p007","quote":"太子興代立，其母為太后。太后自未為嬰齊姬時，嘗與霸陵人安國少季通。及嬰齊薨後，元鼎四年，漢使安國少季往諭王、王太后以入朝，比內諸侯；令辯士諫大夫終軍等宣其辭，勇士魏臣等輔其缺，衛尉路博德將兵屯桂陽，待使者。王年少，太後中國人也，嘗與安國少季通，其使復私焉。國人頗知之，多不附太后。太后恐亂起，亦欲倚漢威，數勸王及群臣求內屬。即因使者上書，請比內諸侯，三歲一朝，除邊關。於是天子許之，賜其丞相呂嘉銀印，及內史、中尉、太傅印，餘得自置。除其故黥劓刑，用漢法，比內諸侯。使者皆留填撫之。王、王太后飭治行裝重齎，為入朝具。","references":[{"kind":"anguoshaozi","title":"《前漢書》卷九十五古注（文淵閣數位轉錄）","url":"https://github.com/kanripo/KR2a0007/blob/683113d4baf6febecaf2ccb7913df87c4d68d454/KR2a0007_095.txt#L281-L283","raw_quote":"太后自未為嬰齊妻時曾與霸陵人安國少季通(師古/曰姓)¶\n(安國字/少季)及嬰齊薨後元鼎四年漢使安國少季諭王王¶\n太后入朝令辯士諫大夫終軍等宣其辭勇士魏臣等¶","source_blob_sha":"b41576d7d677e481940c3a7f222a09837c85e8f7","response_sha256":"ae85076fbcb902242dad85fc3d8b11751e408d228b939c73e8f4c3ee4a879793","response_extent":{"first_line":151,"last_line":300,"partial_file":true},"image_verified":false,"quote":"師古曰姓安國字少季","scope":"ancient_commentary_identity_or_name_components","note":"短引文只除分行、雙行注斜線、括號、段末符與頁標；保留原字。部分回應指紋非全檔hash，Git blob另列。古注亦非影像校勘。"}],"note":"本傳未明少季是名或字；漢書師古注明姓安國字少季，索隱另曰安國姓也少季名也。暫沿前者，名留空，但不是斷言所有來源均未記名；另一說另存可解析組件，未核書影。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"zi":"少季","component_alternatives":[{"components":{"surname":"安國","ming":"少季","zi":null},"source_terms":{"surname":"安國姓也","ming":"少季名也"},"reference":{"title":"《史記索隱》卷25安國少季條","url":"https://github.com/kanripo/KR2a0003/blob/85cc2d3b1952d7a66280628c8d2141d4f1593fc7/KR2a0003_025.txt#L136-L138","quote":"安國姓也少季名也","raw_quote":"(昭云誘/怵好語)樛氏女(上紀虬反樛/姓出邯鄲)藏其先武帝璽(李奇云去/其僭號)¶\n安國少季(安國姓也/少季名也)蒼梧秦王有連(按蒼梧越中王自/名為秦王即下趙)¶\n(光是也故云有連連者連姻/也趙與秦同姓故稱秦王)介漢使者(韋昭曰恃使者/為介胄志林云)¶","source_commit":"85cc2d3b1952d7a66280628c8d2141d4f1593fc7","source_blob_sha":"71e26bc770f73521aca26003b5b86edb720878a6","response_sha256":"9bc292ea0f2b249eb1b5053367e72454e135001e0ca740364fd5dd91089b3ffa","response_extent":{"full_file":true,"reviewed_line_ranges":[[119,155]],"reviewed_full_chapter":false},"scope":"ancient_commentary_alternative_name_components","image_verified":false},"status":"source_claim_not_selected","rationale":"索隱明以少季為名，分源保存；暫沿漢書師古注明字作預設，不據此推生前改名或另建人物。"}],"work_id":